sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant AppGateway as API Gateway
    participant Ingestion as Ingestion & Tokenization
    participant InvertedIndex as Inverted Index
    participant SearchAPI as Search API
    participant Ranker as Relevance Ranker

    %% Post publishing and indexing flow
    Client->>AppGateway: Post publish
    AppGateway-->>Client: Success response
    AppGateway->>Ingestion: Send post data
    Ingestion->>Ingestion: Tokenization
    Ingestion->>InvertedIndex: Inverted index ingestion

    %% Search flow
    Client->>SearchAPI: Search query
    SearchAPI->>SearchAPI: Query parsing
    SearchAPI->>InvertedIndex: Fetch posting lists
    InvertedIndex-->>SearchAPI: Early termination retrieval
    SearchAPI->>Ranker: Send candidate posts
    Ranker->>Ranker: Relevance ranker
    Ranker-->>SearchAPI: Sorted post candidates
    SearchAPI-->>Client: Search results
